Makefile
*.cmake
# v1.16 R4-0: `*.cmake` above targets CMake-GENERATED files. cmake/triplets/
# holds hand-written vcpkg overlay triplets that the CI workflows pass via
# -DVCPKG_OVERLAY_TRIPLETS; they MUST be committed or CI configures against a
# non-existent overlay directory.
!cmake/triplets/*.cmake
DartConfiguration.tcl

